**Goal Model – Multi‑Robot Food Delivery**

| Goal ID | Goal Title                 | Text (with justification)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               | Runtime Annotation | Goal Type | Relation |
|---------|----------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|--------------------|-----------|----------|
| G1      | Deliver Food to Inpatient Room | **Achieve** – “Ensure food is delivered to the inpatient room and the desired condition holds. (Achieve because it guarantees the final state.)” | - | Achieve | – |
| G2      | Execute Delivery            | **Perform** – “Perform delivery using either table or tray method. (Perform because it executes actions.)” | FALLBACK(G2.1, G2.2) | Perform | G1 |
| G2.1    | Deliver to Table             | **Perform** – “Deliver food directly onto the patient’s table using special manipulation skill. (Perform because it performs action.)” | - | Perform | G2 |
| G2.2    | Fetch from Tray              | **Perform** – “Fetch food from robot’s tray requiring cooperation with patient or staff. (Perform because it performs action.)” | - | Perform | G2 |
| G3      | Retrieve Dishes               | **Perform** – “Retrieve dirty dishes from room after meal consumption. (Perform because it executes actions.)” | FALLBACK(G3.1, G3.2) | Perform | G1 |
| G3.1    | Unassisted Dish Retrieval    | **Perform** – “Robot retrieves dishes alone if possible. (Perform because it performs action.)” | - | Perform | G3 |
| G3.2    | Cooperative Dish Retrieval   | **Perform** – “Robot retrieves dishes with another robot or human. (Perform because it performs action.)” | - | Perform | G3 |
| G4      | Open Room Door                | **Perform** – “Open the room door before delivery or retrieval. (Perform because it executes actions.)” | FALLBACK(G4.1, G4.2) | Perform | G2 |
| G4.1    | Robot Opens Door              | **Perform** – “Robot opens door using manipulation skill. (Perform because it performs action.)” | - | Perform | G4 |
| G4.2    | Human Opens Door              | **Perform** – “Human opens door upon robot request. (Perform because it performs action.)” | - | Perform | G4 |

